<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31880" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκδῐκ-άζω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκδεδίκακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					7.3
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cyme</span>):—
				Med.
			, fut. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικῶμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					19.18
				</span></i>
			:—<i>decide,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίαν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκην</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				50
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				17.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκας καὶ γραφὰς καὶ εὐθύνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					3.2
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, of the suit, <i>to be settled,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				958a
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>prosecute one's right against another,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Is.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Delph.</u>
				3(2).205
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					4259
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
				1.129
			</span></i>:—also in 
				Pass.
			,<i>have right done to one</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				195.37
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>avenge,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατέρων..ἐκδικάζοντες φόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1215
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				154
			</span></i> (dub. l.).</div>
